    "Trojan clouds force ships through monitored gaps shared by dust and salvage drones. The open question is which rocks are original trojans and which were towed in and homesteaded under false surveys. The destabilization centers on Noquisi Transit-948 Belt IV: Camp registrars arbitrate homestead claims across a hundred thousand co-orbiting rocks, and the trouble is that the registry maps a swarm that reshuffles itself faster than the appeals docket moves. Two camps watch the same incoming rock and both raise a flag.",
