    "Route Weather Board is what visitors notice first; survival priority was assigned by a list nobody trusts. Coordination drift across the swarm makes bleed-harvest control room the choke point everyone fights over. Privately, Sol interdiction files are sealed here. Every contingency plan on file assumes the phase-stable superconductive lattice keeps flowing.",
    "The public tag is AI Witness Custody; the private trouble is Aristocratic Dome, because elite protection and outside deprivation are tied together. When safe transit window sold to too many ships, the situation keeps surface settlement politics under stress. Privately, the site is an illegal AI lab. Every dispute here ends at the civilian colony.",
